+++
title: Privacy
+++

This Privacy Policy describes the practices of Yomonsni ("we," "us," or
"our") with respect to information collected in connection with
yomonsni.com (the "Site") and the coaching services offered in
connection with it.

**1. Information Collected by the Site.** The Site itself does not
collect, store, or process any personal information regarding its
visitors. No analytics services, tracking technologies, or cookies are
employed for the purpose of monitoring, profiling, or identifying
visitors to the Site.

**2. Booking and Event Registration.** The scheduling of coaching
sessions and registration for workshops or retreats is conducted through
third-party platforms external to the Site. Such platforms collect only
the information voluntarily submitted by the user for the purpose of
completing the applicable booking or registration, and such information
is not retained following the completion of that purpose.

**3. Confidentiality of Coaching Sessions.** All communications and
matters discussed during a coaching session are treated as strictly
confidential. A coach may, in the ordinary course, maintain written
session notes and, solely where the client has provided prior, express
consent, a recording of a session. Such notes and recordings shall not
be disclosed to any third party under any circumstance, except where
disclosure is compelled by a court or other body of competent
jurisdiction pursuant to applicable law, and then only to the extent
such notes or recordings remain in existence at the time such disclosure
is compelled. All session notes and recordings are permanently destroyed
no later than ninety (90) days following the conclusion of the
applicable coaching engagement.
